---
---

<section class="japan-without-compromise" aria-labelledby="jwc-heading">
  <div class="jwc-media" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/journey-japan/images/food/japan-vegetarian-food.webp" alt="Vegetarian dining in Japan" />
    <div class="jwc-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="jj-container jwc-content">
    <div class="jwc-copy reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">JAPAN WITHOUT COMPROMISE</div>
      <h2 id="jwc-heading">Thoughtful vegetarian and Jain-friendly travel in Japan.</h2>
      <p>For travelers with vegetarian or Jain dietary preferences, dining is an important part of the journey. We plan meal arrangements thoughtfully so dietary requirements can be considered alongside the rest of the itinerary.</p>

      <a class="primary-cta" href="/journey-japan/travel-guide/vegetarian-and-jain-food-in-japan/">Learn About Vegetarian &amp; Jain Travel</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.japan-without-compromise{position:relative;min-height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:#111}
.jwc-media{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0}
.jwc-media img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transform:scale(1.03)}
.jwc-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.74) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.48) 52%, rgba(0,0,0,0.14) 100%)}

.jj-container.jwc-content{position:relative;z-index:2;padding-top:72px;padding-bottom:72px}
.jwc-copy{max-width:640px}
.eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--jj-sakura);margin-bottom:14px}
.jwc-copy h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,64px);line-height:1.02;font-weight:500;color:var(--jj-white)}
.jwc-copy p{margin-top:16px;max-width:600px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.84)}

.primary-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--jj-white);color:var(--jj-charcoal);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:24px;transition:background 300ms ease,color 300ms ease,transform 300ms ease}
.primary-cta:hover{background:var(--jj-red);color:var(--jj-white);transform:translateY(-2px)}

@media(max-width:768px){
  .japan-without-compromise{min-height:500px}
  .jj-container.jwc-content{padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px}
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
  .jwc-media img,.primary-cta{transition:none;transform:none}
}
</style>
